---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Wine Adore — Agus Juniartha" description="Wine Adore case study by I Wayan Agus Juniartha, Flutter mobile developer.">
<div class="pf" style="background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh">

<header style="position: sticky; top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); z-index: 10; background: var(--header-bg); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<nav aria-label="Main" style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px">
<a href="/" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center">Agus<span style="color: var(--accent)">.</span></a>
<a href="/#work" style="color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px; min-height: 44px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5M11 18l-6-6 6-6"></path></svg>All work</a>
</nav>
</header>

<main style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 24px 96px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 72px">

<!-- Intro -->
<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; max-width: 800px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent)">Case study · Flutter · iOS &amp; Android</span>
<h1 class="title" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 64px; line-height: 68px; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Wine Adore</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 32px; color: var(--muted)">A premium wine platform for iOS and Android: e-commerce, a personal wine cellar, venues with corkage fees, event booking and a store-credit wallet. Live on both app stores.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; padding-top: 4px">
<a href="#" class="btn btn-p" style="background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); text-decoration: none; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 6px; min-height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px">[App Store link]</a>
<a href="#" class="btn btn-g" style="color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; padding: 0 20px; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; min-height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px">[Google Play link]</a>
</div>
</section>

<div aria-hidden="true" style="border-radius: 12px; background: var(--inverse); color: var(--on-inverse); padding: 40px; min-height: 260px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; overflow: hidden">
<span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 56px; line-height: 56px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; white-space: pre-line">Wine
marketplace</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px">
<svg width="136" height="56" viewBox="0 0 136 56" fill="#6aa5ff"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="28" cy="8" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="48" cy="8" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="68" cy="8" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="88" cy="8" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="108" cy="8" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="128" cy="8" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="28" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="28" cy="28" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="48" cy="28" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="68" cy="28" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="88" cy="28" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="108" cy="28" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="128" cy="28" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="8" cy="48" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="28" cy="48" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="48" cy="48" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="68" cy="48" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="88" cy="48" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="108" cy="48" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="128" cy="48" r="2.5"></circle></svg>
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent)">Live · iOS + Android</span>
</div>
</div>

<!-- Facts -->
<section aria-label="Project facts" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Role</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px">Mobile Developer (Flutter)</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Timeline</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px">Jul 2024 — Present</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Platforms</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px">iOS · Android</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Release</span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px">v1.0.6 on both stores</span></div>
</section>

<!-- Stats -->
<section aria-label="By the numbers" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 24px">
<div style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><span class="stat" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 48px; line-height: 52px; color: var(--accent)">105</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted)">Merged pull requests</span></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><span class="stat" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 48px; line-height: 52px; color: var(--ink)">20</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted)">Feature modules in the codebase</span></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><span class="stat" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 48px; line-height: 52px; color: var(--ink)">~1,000</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted)">Dart files across the app</span></div>
<div style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><span class="stat" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 48px; line-height: 52px; color: var(--ink)">5</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 22px; color: var(--muted)">Payment &amp; sign-in integrations</span></div>
</section>

<!-- Screens -->
<section aria-label="Screens" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 24px">
<div style="aspect-ratio: 9 / 19; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--sunken); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted)">[SHOP SCREEN]</div>
<div style="aspect-ratio: 9 / 19; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--sunken); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted)">[CELLAR SCREEN]</div>
<div style="aspect-ratio: 9 / 19; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--sunken); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted)">[EVENT SCREEN]</div>
<div style="aspect-ratio: 9 / 19; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--sunken); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted)">[VENUE MAP SCREEN]</div>
</section>

<!-- What I built -->
<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; max-width: 640px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent)">What I built</span>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 32px; line-height: 38px; letter-spacing: -0.01em">End-to-end features across the app</h2>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 24px">

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Oct 2024 →</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Events</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Event listing, detail and booking flows, a visitors list, a date-of-birth field, and paying for events with store credit.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Nov — Dec 2024</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Payments &amp; auth</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Apple Sign-In and Google Pay, plus consistent handling of API success codes across auth, payment and address flows.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">2025</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Shop</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Filtering and sorting, multi-shop support, delivery options and times, repeat orders, and cart animations.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">May — Jun 2025</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Cellar inventory</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Inventory screens built from designs, API-backed inventory history, and PDF export.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">2025</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Store-credit wallet</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Top-up, an onboarding flow, filterable history screens and invoice pages.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Venues</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Corkage fee</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Region filters and sorting, cellar browsing with combo chips, a redesigned corkage history, and the payment flow.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Maps</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Venue maps</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">A new Google Maps experience and venue detail map, with "open in maps app" handoff.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Oct 2025</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Deep linking</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Links straight into order history, card history and other detail pages.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Checkout</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Profile &amp; checkout</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">A guest-user profile, a manual checkout flow, and fixes to promo and discount calculation.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Mar — Apr 2026</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Promotions</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">The promotions feature, promo detail pages and target-type validation, plus a redesigned wine detail page.</p>
</article>

<article style="padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Ongoing</span>
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 26px">Reliability</h3>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--muted)">Offline and poor-connection handling, empty states, an Android keyboard fix, a Swift Package Manager / CocoaPods adjustment, and bug-fix sprints.</p>
</article>

</div>
</section>

<!-- Stack -->
<section class="split" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 28px; line-height: 34px">Tech stack</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">App</span>
<ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px"><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Flutter</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Dart</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">GetX</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Provider</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">auto_route</li></ul></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Firebase</span>
<ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px"><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Auth</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Firestore</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Messaging</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Remote Config</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Crashlytics</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Analytics</li></ul></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Payments &amp; sign-in</span>
<ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px"><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Stripe</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Google Pay</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Apple Pay</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Google Sign-In</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Apple Sign-In</li></ul></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px"><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Platform &amp; workflow</span>
<ul style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px"><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Google Maps</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Deep links</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Codemagic CI/CD</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">FVM</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Pre-commit hooks</li><li style="padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent-soft)">Conventional Commits</li></ul></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- Outcome -->
<section class="split" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 280px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 28px; line-height: 34px">Outcome</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--muted)">
<p style="margin: 0">I shipped 100+ merged pull requests to a production Flutter app that is live on the App Store and Google Play, building complete flows for events, shop, store credit, cellar inventory, corkage venues and promotions.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">Along the way I kept a large, 20-module codebase healthy with offline handling, consistent error handling and steady UI polish.</p>
<p style="margin: 0">[ADD A REAL METRIC IF YOU HAVE ONE — DOWNLOADS, STORE RATING, ORDERS.]</p>
</div>
</section>

<a href="/#work" class="card" style="align-self: flex-start; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; text-decoration: none; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--raised); min-width: 280px">
<span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">More work</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 28px; color: var(--ink)">AJB ERP, Vacaba and more →</span>
</a>
</main>
</div>
</Base>

